      "paperId": "4a625bb94bea6fa2e9f70a7d7c392dea676e66b5",
      "title": "\u2018Enthusiasm\u2019 in Burke\u2019s and Kant\u2019s Response to the French Revolution",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Christos Grigoriou",
